# WITHDRAWN: nine-no-root k=5, D=-1, d_root=0, p=5 orientation narrowing

Date of withdrawal: 2026-09-29

The certificate previously stored at this path is invalid and must not be used.

The error is a dual-space reversal. For this branch, the global external coefficient-constraint space is a rank-four subspace

    P <= Q^9,

and every actual-empty local coefficient space satisfies

    E_b <= P.

The withdrawn argument instead defined `W=P^perp` and tested

    span(E_b) <= W.

That containment is false in general. Consequently its claimed exclusions of S2, S5, S6, and S7, and its claimed residual frontier S1, S3, S4, S8, are not theorem-level results.

